    <grid>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "name": "1 column layout",
  "sections": [
    {
      "grid": "12",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "309e2d4b-2d7d-4f87-ba89-b73f65ff57bf",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\">\n<p>Since 2018 our teams have been involved in  watched one of the largest greenfields mining projects in Africa develop into Vedanta Zinc International's Gamsberg Mine Project.</p>\n<p>Their new R7-billion expansion is expected to double Gamsberg’s yearly ore capacity, making VZI and South Africa the largest zinc producer in Africa.</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2249,
                    "udi": "umb://media/e355f16a82d141549fa7f9109e2fb134",
                    "image": "/media/ntyfly4r/z7.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><em>Gamsberg Mine from the main road and the main facility with the crushing plant in the distance. <br /></em></p>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Split",
          "id": "9d3ba9a4-eb3b-4dcf-a02a-be1e9be31f8e",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Our Work Begins</span></p>\n<p><span>\"Three years after the first blast, I was testing concrete for Murray and Dickson Construction (Pty) Ltd, Teichmann and ET-X Projects at the crusher plant.\"</span></p>\n<p><span>Sector Maifo was the senior technician at Phase 1 of the Gamsberg Mine Project in 2018. </span></p>\n<p><span>For 2 years he oversaw the work Roadlab performed to enable the crusher and conveying systems, from</span><span></span><span> the establishing of the foundations to the final concrete pour.</span></p>\n<p><span>This included geotechnical and earthworks investigations, sampling and all concrete testing for the construction of this first section. </span><span></span></p>\n<p><span>President Cyril Ramaphosa officially opened Gamsberg Mine the following year in 2019. <br /></span></p>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            },
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2244,
                    "udi": "umb://media/a2da47b4a5164be9b42181276292a6e5",
                    "image": "/media/wjdnviqw/final-16.png"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2245,
                    "udi": "umb://media/641ad4fa47a8471a83c7bee6e90abf81",
                    "image": "/media/5tkbuzfi/untitled-12.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "51c1cd0c-48b2-41a9-be33-9b4eecbe8a08",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Gamsberg Phase 1<br /></span></p>\n<p>Vedanta Zinc launched the R5.5 billion first phase of the Gamsberg mine in March 2019.</p>\n<p>The Gamsberg Phase 1 project comprises of a dedicated processing plant and an open pit mine that taps into one of the largest known undeveloped zinc ore bodies in the world.</p>\n<p>Gamsberg Phase 1 has a total life-of-mine (LOM) estimated at over 30 years.</p>\n<p>In addition to a zinc production capacity of four million tonnes per annum, Gamsberg also produces 250,000tpa of zinc concentrate from its concentrator plant.</p>\n<p>Crushing, milled and processed ore is sent to a concentrator for zinc concentrate production. The final product is transported to the Western Cape's Saldanha port for shipment across the world.</p>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2242,
                    "udi": "umb://media/0582b01f4d3e4bcca7c6364d1e3e355e",
                    "image": "/media/dgyiebj4/z3.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><em>Aggeneys is 66 km from Pofadder and 110km from Springbok, home of the district municipality office.</em></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Split",
          "id": "6d107414-7ca4-46df-b889-ef2db1f2c94f",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Phase 2 Expansion</span></p>\n<div class=\"td-a-rec td-a-rec-id-content_inlineleft  td_uid_12_633d70de2eeea_rand td_block_template_1\">\n<div class=\"td-visible-desktop\">\n<div id=\"beacon_1c824f1e1b\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 0px; visibility: hidden;\"><img style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px;\" src=\"https://ads-za.privatelabel.co.za/www/delivery/lg.php?bannerid=1428&amp;campaignid=218&amp;zoneid=32&amp;loc=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.miningmx.com%2Fnews%2Fbase-metals%2F49235-vedanta-approves-r7bn-project-to-double-up-zinc-from-gamsberg-facilities-in-northern-cape%2F&amp;referer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2F&amp;cb=1c824f1e1b\" alt=\"\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Under Phase 2, Gamsberg is expected to double its annual ore capacity from 4Mt to 8Mt per year.</p>\n<p>The expansion infrastructure includes another 4Mtpa concentrator plant, estimated to produce 200 to 250Ktpa of additional zinc concentrate.</p>\n<p>Construction of the new plant is expected to take up to 22 months and produce +2000 jobs during the construction phase and a further +800 permanent jobs once operations begin in 2024.</p>\n<p>Today, Roadlab is helping determine the kind of foundations that will be required to support the loads and forces the new plant will experience.</p>\n<p>\"We are privileged to be back, this time as a service provider to Vedanta itself,\" says Matthew Fisher, Roadlab Group Business Development Manager.</p>\n<p>\"We are currently working to establish the underlying geological conditions at the site of this major expansion, after which we will be conducting test pits and material investigations.\"</p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            },
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2250,
                    "udi": "umb://media/87f712e98b6149f8b31f4b772add1e54",
                    "image": "/media/32jppb1b/matthew-fisher.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2247,
                    "udi": "umb://media/bb17ff0bfc904177a7e223116d8daa89",
                    "image": "/media/bx5bpo2q/vedanta-new.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "f695f4fd-0e3c-4d11-8624-d34f2df13458",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p> </p>\n<hr />\n<p> </p>\n<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Interested in our work?</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Reach out to us.</span></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": null
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
